  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environment-Client-blue\" alt=\"\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fefekos.dev%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/985625288891326504?label=efekosdev&color=blue\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-closed/efekos/FancyHealthBar?color=blue\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/efekos/FancyHealthBar?color=blue\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/efekos/FancyHealthBar\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/efekos/FancyHealthBar?style=flat\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/990963?logo=curseforge&logoColor=#f16436&color=#f16436\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/fancy-health-bar?logo=modrinth&logoColor=#1bd96a&label=modrinth&color=#1bd96a\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>FancyHealthBar</h1>\n<p><strong>自 1.2 版本起，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 為存取選項選單的必備模組。若未安裝 Mod Menu，您將僅能使用預設設定。</strong></p>\n<p>這款純客戶端模組徹底重作了生命值顯示，並新增多種可自訂的功能。</p>\n<h2>血條粒子效果</h2>\n<p>原版生命值顯示現已作為「Vanilla（原版）」樣式提供。預設情況下，生命值減少時愛心會碎裂成粒子飛散。您可透過選項選單自由調整粒子效果。</p>\n<h2>多種樣式</h2>\n<p>您可透過選項選單切換不同的血條樣式。若您有新的血條樣式構想，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/efekos/FancyHealthBar/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤頁面</a> 提出建議！</p>\n<p>原版血條粒子效果示範：\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/efekos/FancyHealthBar/master/img/showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
